@host = http://localhost:5101
@token = COLE_AQUI_O_ACCESS_TOKEN
@taskId = COLE_AQUI_O_ID
### Cadastro
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Mateus Demo","email":"teste@example.com","password":"TesteForte2026!"}
### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"teste@example.com","password":"TesteForte2026!"}
### Criar tarefa
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Estudar injeção de dependência","description":"Separar Controllers e Services"}
### Listar
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
### Concluir
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Done"}
